1
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:40,030
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,110 --> 00:01:43,000
[Episode 12: Regent]

3
00:01:46,789 --> 00:01:47,350
Fall in!

4
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:05,860
Go to the bottom cabin.

5
00:02:05,870 --> 00:02:06,400
Go to the bottom cabin!

6
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,120
Doctor Su!

7
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:07,950
Let's go.

8
00:02:12,580 --> 00:02:13,030
Hurry!

9
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:13,840
Hurry up!

10
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:14,310
Hurry!

11
00:02:18,570 --> 00:02:19,430
Draw your bows!

12
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:27,280
Careful.

13
00:02:27,570 --> 00:02:28,430
Your Highness.

14
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:31,820
Eunuch Zhu.

15
00:02:31,980 --> 00:02:33,950
Aren't we waiting for the Xie brothers
to come out first?

16
00:02:33,950 --> 00:02:35,010
Is that important?

17
00:02:35,020 --> 00:02:35,650
Fire!

18
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:43,980
Xianlun!

19
00:02:48,850 --> 00:02:49,820
Aim carefully!

20
00:02:50,570 --> 00:02:51,400
Fire!

21
00:02:54,510 --> 00:02:55,370
Your Highness!

22
00:02:55,380 --> 00:02:58,040
They're soldiers from
the Brave Warriors Camp!

23
00:02:59,630 --> 00:03:00,860
It can't be Zhu Bukha.

24
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:04,970
It's Zhu Bukha!

25
00:03:04,970 --> 00:03:05,640
Move!

26
00:03:05,850 --> 00:03:06,660
Don't just sit there!

27
00:03:06,660 --> 00:03:07,260
Come here!

28
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:08,330
Impossible.

29
00:03:08,530 --> 00:03:09,390
Impossible...

30
00:03:11,110 --> 00:03:12,100
We have to go.

31
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:24,770
Impossible.

32
00:03:27,020 --> 00:03:27,650
Impossible.

33
00:03:27,650 --> 00:03:29,260
How could Zhu Bukha still be alive?

34
00:03:29,260 --> 00:03:31,190
How could Zhu Bukha still be alive?

35
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,380
Impossible...

36
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:33,470
Doctor Su.

37
00:03:34,310 --> 00:03:34,950
Doctor Su!

38
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:37,340
Look at the situation.

39
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:39,360
We must escape before we die here.

40
00:03:39,690 --> 00:03:40,260
Let's go!

41
00:03:48,350 --> 00:03:49,380
Draw your bows.

42
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:51,750
Fire!

43
00:04:00,310 --> 00:04:01,080
Little Xingren.

44
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,740
What are you doing? Come here.

45
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,810
Grab an axe and join me.

46
00:04:06,940 --> 00:04:07,440
Okay.

47
00:04:21,410 --> 00:04:22,210
Rectifier Yu.

48
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:23,190
Coming.

49
00:04:27,580 --> 00:04:28,440
Your Highness.

50
00:04:28,820 --> 00:04:30,400
Carry all this gunpowder up.

51
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:30,850
Yes.

52
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:31,670
Hurry up.

53
00:04:41,409 --> 00:04:42,409
Move it to the bow.

54
00:04:42,580 --> 00:04:43,130
Come on.

55
00:04:48,550 --> 00:04:49,680
Good-for-Nothing!

56
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,920
Is this the only path left
for us, a road to death?

57
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,850
That's right!

58
00:04:53,950 --> 00:04:56,480
It's a road to death,
but also a way to survive.

59
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:58,490
Come on.

60
00:05:45,190 --> 00:05:45,870
Old Mule!

61
00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:46,810
Hurry up!

62
00:05:46,830 --> 00:05:47,730
Be quick!

63
00:05:48,010 --> 00:05:49,870
Stop yelling. We can't rush this.

64
00:06:00,910 --> 00:06:01,580
Done.

65
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:02,810
Let's go.

66
00:06:14,900 --> 00:06:16,030
Hurry up, everyone.

67
00:06:19,310 --> 00:06:20,170
Your Highness!

68
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,280
Your Highness, go quickly!

69
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:21,870
I'm fine!

70
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:22,700
It's lit.

71
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,430
Hurry up. Go.

72
00:06:23,430 --> 00:06:24,340
Your Highness, you go first.

73
00:06:24,340 --> 00:06:25,330
-You go first.
-Let's go together.

74
00:06:25,330 --> 00:06:28,190
-Let's go.
-You go first. Let’s go together. Hurry.

75
00:06:41,510 --> 00:06:42,370
Draw your bows.

76
00:06:43,370 --> 00:06:44,070
Doctor Su!

77
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,260
Let's go!

78
00:06:46,020 --> 00:06:46,580
Let's go.

79
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:48,670
Let's go!

80
00:06:48,690 --> 00:06:49,310
Fire!

81
00:06:49,820 --> 00:06:50,460
Let's go!

82
00:06:50,700 --> 00:06:51,870
Doctor Su, let's go!

83
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,950
Good-for-Nothing, what's wrong?

84
00:06:58,950 --> 00:07:00,680
The hole is going to be blocked!

85
00:07:02,870 --> 00:07:03,470
Doctor Su.

86
00:07:04,510 --> 00:07:05,310
Give me a hand.

87
00:07:11,110 --> 00:07:12,820
One, two, three!

88
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:18,430
Is it open?

89
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:25,570
Did it open?

90
00:07:33,690 --> 00:07:34,310
Yu Qian?

91
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:35,340
Yu Qian!

92
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:37,150
Good-for-Nothing?

93
00:07:37,550 --> 00:07:38,260
Doctor Su?

94
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:41,650
Wu Dingyuan?

95
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:03,430
Hurry up.

96
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:43,500
Be careful, Eunuch Zhu.

97
00:08:43,500 --> 00:08:44,390
It's dangerous down there.

98
00:08:44,390 --> 00:08:45,590
Wait here, all of you.

99
00:09:53,790 --> 00:09:54,720
Are you all dead?

100
00:10:00,860 --> 00:10:01,620
You're dead.

101
00:10:25,620 --> 00:10:26,350
You're dead!

102
00:10:36,270 --> 00:10:37,340
Zhu Bukha,

103
00:10:37,870 --> 00:10:39,930
have you done right by the Ming Empire

104
00:10:40,260 --> 00:10:41,760
and my grandfather?

105
00:11:06,660 --> 00:11:10,050
♪ Why do the cherry blossoms
fear neither wind nor frost? ♪

106
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:13,380
♪ Looking back on this life,
who can remain true to their devotion? ♪

107
00:11:13,620 --> 00:11:17,470
♪ If this life is destined
to rise and fall ♪

108
00:11:17,490 --> 00:11:21,930
♪ Then let us break through
one barrier at a time ♪

109
00:11:22,030 --> 00:11:25,520
♪ Together, let us climb over
every high wall ♪

110
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:29,620
♪ Together, let us break through
every obstacle ♪

111
00:11:29,660 --> 00:11:32,830
♪ No matter how fierce the storm,
no matter how the world shakes ♪

112
00:11:32,850 --> 00:11:36,540
♪ Never think of making us surrender ♪

113
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:39,930
♪ Together, let us laugh
at the fickleness of the world ♪

114
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:43,460
♪ Together, let us sing
until the light of dawn ♪

115
00:11:43,660 --> 00:11:46,830
♪ With you by my side, this life
has not been lived in vain ♪

116
00:11:46,850 --> 00:11:50,410
♪ Looking back at us,
all the way we have come ♪

117
00:11:50,810 --> 00:11:54,300
♪ Together, let us climb over
every high wall ♪

118
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:58,070
♪ Together, let us break through
every obstacle ♪

119
00:11:57,070 --> 00:11:57,930
Your Highness!

120
00:11:58,090 --> 00:12:01,250
♪ No matter how fierce the storm,
no matter how the world shakes ♪

121
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:05,030
♪ Never think of making us surrender ♪

122
00:12:02,670 --> 00:12:03,470
Rectifier Yu!

123
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,270
Your Highness!

124
00:12:05,060 --> 00:12:08,430
♪ Together, let us laugh
at the fickleness of the world ♪

125
00:12:08,450 --> 00:12:11,950
♪ Together, let us sing
until the light of dawn ♪

126
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:15,320
♪ With you by my side, this life
has not been lived in vain ♪

127
00:12:15,350 --> 00:12:18,740
♪ Looking back at us,
all the way we have come ♪

128
00:12:18,870 --> 00:12:22,080
♪ What is most unforgettable? ♪

129
00:12:33,530 --> 00:12:34,310
How are you?

130
00:12:35,770 --> 00:12:37,170
I'm fine, Your Highness.

131
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,660
How are you?

132
00:12:40,990 --> 00:12:42,120
Good-for-Nothing.

133
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:51,950
I wonder what the person plotting treason

134
00:12:51,950 --> 00:12:53,620
promised Zhu Bukha

135
00:12:54,820 --> 00:12:56,750
to make him risk his life like this.

136
00:12:58,810 --> 00:13:00,460
I've seen many people like this

137
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:02,580
in the Yingtian Prefectural Office.

138
00:13:08,670 --> 00:13:10,130
From Jinling to Yangzhou,

139
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:12,620
we've been through quite a struggle.

140
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:13,670
Moving on,

141
00:13:15,370 --> 00:13:17,370
things will definitely get harder.

142
00:13:18,220 --> 00:13:19,350
Good-for-Nothing,

143
00:13:19,980 --> 00:13:20,950
if I ever

144
00:13:22,620 --> 00:13:24,820
find myself on the brink of death again,

145
00:13:25,430 --> 00:13:27,360
would you risk your life to save me?

146
00:13:28,580 --> 00:13:29,390
Risk my life?

147
00:13:30,740 --> 00:13:31,500
Impossible.

148
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,150
I can't do it.

149
00:13:34,310 --> 00:13:35,150
I guessed it.

150
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:37,480
A coward like you

151
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,610
would never save me.

152
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:40,220
Fine.

153
00:13:40,550 --> 00:13:41,950
If that day really comes,

154
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,370
I won't beg anyone for help.

155
00:13:47,790 --> 00:13:49,590
But you're one of the rare people

156
00:13:49,590 --> 00:13:51,200
who dare to tell me the truth.

157
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:57,490
Let's go!

158
00:13:57,750 --> 00:13:58,430
Up we go!

159
00:14:52,270 --> 00:14:54,530
In that bloody battle at Hulan Hushiwen,

160
00:14:56,570 --> 00:14:58,710
6,000 soldiers died in battle.

161
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:03,120
Of the five eunuchs from
the Directorate of the Imperial Stables,

162
00:15:03,150 --> 00:15:04,570
only you, Zhu Bukha,

163
00:15:04,570 --> 00:15:05,820
stayed by my side.

164
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:17,710
You were afraid I would be weak

165
00:15:18,790 --> 00:15:19,740
and give up.

166
00:15:21,820 --> 00:15:24,340
So you kept repeating one sentence:

167
00:15:26,190 --> 00:15:27,790
"Heaven is biased;

168
00:15:31,790 --> 00:15:34,720
both wolves and sheep
have to fight for their lives."

169
00:15:43,890 --> 00:15:46,120
At the time,
I found the saying rather awkward,

170
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:48,120
so I changed it to "Heaven is unfair,

171
00:15:48,290 --> 00:15:50,620
but the human heart remains unyielding."

172
00:15:55,390 --> 00:15:56,100
Lord Zhan.

173
00:15:56,790 --> 00:15:57,430
Lord Zhan.

174
00:15:58,610 --> 00:16:02,030
[Zhan Peng, Zhu Zhanyu's Attendant]

175
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,500
As soon as I saw this fan,

176
00:16:00,810 --> 00:16:01,790
I rushed over.

177
00:16:02,150 --> 00:16:02,950
The master...

178
00:16:03,100 --> 00:16:04,070
Where is he?

179
00:16:05,930 --> 00:16:07,660
Great merchant, Steward Wang.

180
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:09,350
If you'd been one step late,

181
00:16:09,770 --> 00:16:11,830
you would have missed this good show.

182
00:16:15,690 --> 00:16:16,430
Lord Zhan.

183
00:16:16,950 --> 00:16:17,980
Here at the dock,

184
00:16:18,770 --> 00:16:20,290
there are all kinds of people

185
00:16:20,290 --> 00:16:21,430
and shows every day.

186
00:16:22,410 --> 00:16:24,550
Next time the master visits,

187
00:16:24,790 --> 00:16:26,720
I will personally show him around.

188
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:32,370
The master wants to know...

189
00:16:32,950 --> 00:16:34,670
Did your family's grain boats

190
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:38,340
ever transport a batch of
Wuxi spring peaches to the palace?

191
00:16:38,340 --> 00:16:39,070
Yes.

192
00:16:40,410 --> 00:16:41,820
Every year at this time,

193
00:16:42,190 --> 00:16:43,360
the first batch of spring peaches

194
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,880
is transported by me.

195
00:16:45,190 --> 00:16:46,920
In the name of the Crown Prince?

196
00:16:47,030 --> 00:16:48,360
In previous years, yes.

197
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:51,100
But this year, they said
the Crown Prince went south

198
00:16:51,100 --> 00:16:52,390
and couldn't oversee this,

199
00:16:52,390 --> 00:16:54,250
so the Crown Princess handled it.

200
00:16:54,690 --> 00:16:55,910
This old woman.

201
00:16:57,050 --> 00:16:58,460
Master! Master!

202
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:00,110
Master!

203
00:17:00,390 --> 00:17:01,430
The person who was blown up

204
00:17:01,430 --> 00:17:05,450
is Zhu Bukha, the eunuch superintendent
of the Directorate of the Imperial Stables.

205
00:17:05,450 --> 00:17:07,780
My master has truly predicted everything.

206
00:17:07,780 --> 00:17:08,670
Next,

207
00:17:09,450 --> 00:17:10,460
it's all up to you.

208
00:17:11,220 --> 00:17:11,829
No, no.

209
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:14,780
I am just a merchant.

210
00:17:15,109 --> 00:17:16,589
I cannot commit treason.

211
00:17:16,589 --> 00:17:17,430
Treason?

212
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:23,910
The throne

213
00:17:24,609 --> 00:17:26,940
should have belonged to the Prince of Han.

214
00:17:28,210 --> 00:17:28,730
Yes.

215
00:17:29,170 --> 00:17:30,730
I misspoke, I misspoke.

216
00:17:31,390 --> 00:17:31,920
But...

217
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,550
Lord Zhan, look.

218
00:17:33,900 --> 00:17:36,680
If I really had such ambition,

219
00:17:36,840 --> 00:17:38,330
when I delivered
the treasure ship that day,

220
00:17:38,330 --> 00:17:40,500
I could have attacked the Crown Prince.

221
00:17:40,500 --> 00:17:41,700
My master knows.

222
00:17:41,930 --> 00:17:43,540
That's why he sent me.

223
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:46,990
As long as you listen to me,

224
00:17:48,330 --> 00:17:49,020
my master

225
00:17:50,040 --> 00:17:51,600
can keep you safe.

226
00:18:12,130 --> 00:18:14,070
I, Wang Ji, a merchant from Yangzhou,

227
00:18:14,070 --> 00:18:16,870
am here to welcome
Your Highness the Crown Prince.

228
00:18:19,740 --> 00:18:21,570
The old fox finally showed up.

229
00:18:22,890 --> 00:18:23,780
Wang Ji.

230
00:18:24,700 --> 00:18:25,550
Master Wang.

231
00:18:26,670 --> 00:18:27,730
What a coincidence

232
00:18:27,970 --> 00:18:29,360
to run into you here.

233
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,390
Your Highness.

234
00:18:37,870 --> 00:18:38,920
You saw it all.

235
00:18:39,740 --> 00:18:41,700
It was Eunuch Zhu Bukha.

236
00:18:42,980 --> 00:18:44,390
I really

237
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,800
have no intention of rebelling.

238
00:18:47,150 --> 00:18:47,830
Is that so?

239
00:18:49,300 --> 00:18:50,950
I'm where I am today

240
00:18:51,450 --> 00:18:53,310
thanks to your brilliant methods

241
00:18:53,780 --> 00:18:54,780
and schemes.

242
00:18:56,870 --> 00:18:57,930
The scheme of the two capitals

243
00:18:57,930 --> 00:18:58,990
is no small matter.

244
00:19:00,280 --> 00:19:02,260
I am just a commoner.

245
00:19:03,330 --> 00:19:04,460
Actually, all of you

246
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:06,600
forced me to do this.

247
00:19:13,650 --> 00:19:15,300
You shameless merchant.

248
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:17,440
It's one thing to seek wealth.

249
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:19,320
But to attempt to usurp the state?

250
00:19:19,670 --> 00:19:21,220
Such wild ambition.

251
00:19:21,450 --> 00:19:23,190
How arrogant and rebellious!

252
00:19:23,700 --> 00:19:25,220
You're about to die,

253
00:19:25,590 --> 00:19:27,320
yet you're still talking back.

254
00:19:27,340 --> 00:19:28,140
Take him away.

255
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:34,490
Move!

256
00:19:38,770 --> 00:19:39,370
Hurry up.

257
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:40,320
Move!

258
00:19:41,300 --> 00:19:41,870
Move!

259
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:24,060
Eunuch Zhu.

260
00:20:25,060 --> 00:20:25,910
Zhu Bukha!

261
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,190
Get up.

262
00:20:28,500 --> 00:20:30,980
Get up, get up!

263
00:20:31,630 --> 00:20:34,500
Get up, get up!

264
00:21:00,580 --> 00:21:04,160
[Young Wang Jingshu]

265
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:05,290
♪ A tile catches the cool evening rain ♪

266
00:21:03,540 --> 00:21:04,780
Su Jingxi!

267
00:21:05,020 --> 00:21:07,780
[Young Su Jingxi]

268
00:21:05,660 --> 00:21:07,490
I'll come back when I'm free.

269
00:21:06,630 --> 00:21:11,720
♪ A blade of grass
endures the freezing seasons ♪

270
00:21:08,700 --> 00:21:09,670
What did you say?

271
00:21:09,950 --> 00:21:10,910
I said,

272
00:21:11,190 --> 00:21:13,170
I'll come back when I'm free.

273
00:21:12,060 --> 00:21:17,860
♪ A touch of green emerges,
enduring through rootless years ♪

274
00:21:17,060 --> 00:21:18,280
Okay!

275
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:23,760
♪ Who remembers that I had a dream too ♪

276
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:39,030
[Scallion]

277
00:21:43,960 --> 00:21:45,190
What should we do?

278
00:21:50,010 --> 00:21:52,520
[Lord Lyu, Vice Minister of Rites]

279
00:21:55,980 --> 00:21:56,840
Your Highness.

280
00:22:06,760 --> 00:22:09,400
Sending the Crown Prince's
personal jade pendant

281
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:11,000
and the scorched dragon robe

282
00:22:11,150 --> 00:22:12,670
back to Beijing at this time

283
00:22:11,410 --> 00:22:15,840
[Zhu Gaoxi, Prince of Han]

284
00:22:13,650 --> 00:22:16,060
must be your doing, right?

285
00:22:16,630 --> 00:22:19,060
Is the Crown Prince really dead?

286
00:22:19,760 --> 00:22:20,950
What's the rush?

287
00:22:22,190 --> 00:22:23,990
Life and death are predestined.

288
00:22:24,500 --> 00:22:26,760
Jinling is thousands of li
away from Beijing.

289
00:22:26,760 --> 00:22:27,560
Along the way,

290
00:22:27,560 --> 00:22:29,860
no one can say for sure what obstacles

291
00:22:30,090 --> 00:22:31,780
he might encounter.

292
00:22:33,300 --> 00:22:34,350
It's just

293
00:22:35,190 --> 00:22:36,740
making my sister-in-law

294
00:22:36,980 --> 00:22:39,190
suffer for a few more days.

295
00:22:39,600 --> 00:22:41,930
Your Highness's plans are far-reaching.

296
00:22:42,110 --> 00:22:43,370
But a long delay brings many risks...

297
00:22:43,370 --> 00:22:46,300
It is the will of the people
and the trend of the times.

298
00:22:47,540 --> 00:22:49,870
But fire requires the impetus of the wind.

299
00:22:49,870 --> 00:22:50,630
So,

300
00:22:51,670 --> 00:22:52,870
we still need you

301
00:22:53,740 --> 00:22:55,800
to fan the flames a bit more, Lord Lyu.

302
00:22:56,280 --> 00:22:57,080
I understand.

303
00:22:58,190 --> 00:23:00,060
I will take my leave.

304
00:23:30,690 --> 00:23:32,740
The Empress arrives!

305
00:23:41,430 --> 00:23:43,110
Let the Prince act as regent?

306
00:23:44,610 --> 00:23:45,390
Qian Lu.

307
00:23:45,560 --> 00:23:48,480
[Qian Lu, Construction Bureau
of the Ministry of Works]

308
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:48,670
You are just a registrar
in the Ministry of Works.

309
00:23:48,670 --> 00:23:50,720
Who allowed you to enter the main hall

310
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:52,250
and discuss state affairs?

311
00:23:55,700 --> 00:23:56,500
Your Majesty.

312
00:23:56,590 --> 00:23:58,290
I am indeed a minor official,

313
00:23:58,620 --> 00:24:00,160
but Lu Fangweng once said,

314
00:24:00,390 --> 00:24:02,330
"Even in a lowly position, one must never
forget one's duty to the nation."

315
00:24:02,330 --> 00:24:03,870
Now His Majesty is unwell,

316
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:06,600
and the Crown Prince
is stuck in Jinling...

317
00:24:06,610 --> 00:24:07,260
Insolent!

318
00:24:07,520 --> 00:24:08,390
Desperate times

319
00:24:08,390 --> 00:24:09,500
call for desperate measures.

320
00:24:09,500 --> 00:24:10,280
Although court affairs

321
00:24:10,280 --> 00:24:11,800
are temporarily managed by Your Majesty,

322
00:24:11,800 --> 00:24:12,930
the cabinet affairs

323
00:24:13,110 --> 00:24:14,910
cannot be left without a leader.

324
00:24:15,930 --> 00:24:16,950
He's right.

325
00:24:19,690 --> 00:24:20,950
Left without a leader?

326
00:24:22,380 --> 00:24:24,310
With so many people in the cabinet,

327
00:24:24,800 --> 00:24:26,660
how can you say there is no leader?

328
00:24:27,060 --> 00:24:27,860
Your Majesty.

329
00:24:30,650 --> 00:24:32,190
When His Majesty was unwell before,

330
00:24:32,190 --> 00:24:33,020
we thought

331
00:24:33,260 --> 00:24:34,930
even if state affairs
were temporarily delayed,

332
00:24:34,930 --> 00:24:37,370
it wouldn't be too late to handle
them after His Majesty recovered.

333
00:24:37,370 --> 00:24:38,540
But now His Majesty

334
00:24:39,460 --> 00:24:40,910
needs to rest indefinitely...

335
00:24:40,910 --> 00:24:42,540
What exactly
are you trying to say, Lord Lyu?

336
00:24:42,540 --> 00:24:44,390
I request that Your Majesty follow
the precedent of Emperor Taizong,

337
00:24:44,390 --> 00:24:46,500
where the Crown Prince
or a prince stays behind to govern.

338
00:24:46,500 --> 00:24:47,870
While His Majesty is ill,

339
00:24:47,870 --> 00:24:49,200
please temporarily appoint a prince

340
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:51,740
of high status and prestige
to assist in governance and act as regent,

341
00:24:51,740 --> 00:24:53,000
and explicitly order all ministries

342
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:55,670
and the cabinet to defer all decisions
on state affairs to the regent,

343
00:24:55,670 --> 00:24:56,930
to reassure the people

344
00:24:57,700 --> 00:24:59,100
and stabilize the court.

345
00:25:00,610 --> 00:25:02,670
Someone of high status and prestige?

346
00:25:03,930 --> 00:25:05,350
Who are you speaking for?

347
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:09,540
I am merely making a request
based on the old precedent.

348
00:25:10,040 --> 00:25:11,190
Is it Prince of Han?

349
00:25:12,240 --> 00:25:13,740
Are you speaking for him?

350
00:25:15,150 --> 00:25:17,080
Your Majesty is absolutely right.

351
00:25:17,220 --> 00:25:19,350
Lord Lyu's proposal is preposterous.

352
00:25:19,800 --> 00:25:20,810
The duty of overseeing the state

353
00:25:20,810 --> 00:25:21,900
cannot be discussed lightly.

354
00:25:21,900 --> 00:25:23,890
If a vassal king
easily interferes in politics,

355
00:25:23,890 --> 00:25:25,980
how can the court discipline
be maintained,

356
00:25:25,980 --> 00:25:28,180
and where will the law of the land stand?

357
00:25:28,230 --> 00:25:30,220
Lord Liu, that is not quite correct.

358
00:25:30,220 --> 00:25:32,330
If overseeing the state
means disrupting national discipline,

359
00:25:32,330 --> 00:25:34,220
when Emperor Taizong personally
led the expedition to the Northern Desert,

360
00:25:34,220 --> 00:25:35,960
he ordered the Crown Prince
to oversee the state.

361
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:36,830
Could it be

362
00:25:37,670 --> 00:25:39,110
that it was also an absurd act?

363
00:25:39,110 --> 00:25:40,430
During Emperor Taizong's reign,

364
00:25:40,430 --> 00:25:42,930
the Crown Prince assisted in governance.
He did not act as a regent.

365
00:25:42,930 --> 00:25:45,700
Vassal kings are not allowed
to overstep their ranks to attend court.

366
00:25:45,700 --> 00:25:47,780
This is the ancestral law.

367
00:25:47,890 --> 00:25:49,690
I am talking about assisting
in governance and overseeing the state,

368
00:25:49,690 --> 00:25:51,050
not acting as regent.

369
00:25:57,780 --> 00:25:59,350
I have heard

370
00:25:59,980 --> 00:26:02,590
what all of you have said.

371
00:26:03,170 --> 00:26:07,110
In times of emergency,
we need to work together.

372
00:26:07,850 --> 00:26:10,910
I also have to rely on
all the royal relatives and vassal kings

373
00:26:10,910 --> 00:26:12,510
to save the nation together.

374
00:26:12,890 --> 00:26:13,530
Haishou.

375
00:26:13,800 --> 00:26:14,300
Yes.

376
00:26:14,660 --> 00:26:16,720
Take this memorial outside the hall,

377
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:21,010
ask the chief officials of all ministries
to take a look,

378
00:26:21,300 --> 00:26:22,850
and hear what they have to say.

379
00:26:22,850 --> 00:26:23,390
Yes.

380
00:26:31,460 --> 00:26:32,670
Your Majesty is wise.

381
00:26:33,980 --> 00:26:35,430
I second the motion.

382
00:26:35,870 --> 00:26:41,740
I second the motion.

383
00:26:48,460 --> 00:26:49,150
Haishou,

384
00:26:49,740 --> 00:26:51,060
tell them to stop following us.

385
00:26:51,060 --> 00:26:51,650
Yes.

386
00:27:02,460 --> 00:27:03,670
I have been wondering

387
00:27:03,740 --> 00:27:05,350
what the rebels will do next.

388
00:27:05,610 --> 00:27:07,030
But that's all they've got.

389
00:27:07,030 --> 00:27:08,730
By merely suggesting
a prince act as regent,

390
00:27:08,730 --> 00:27:10,860
they want me to hand over power.

391
00:27:12,380 --> 00:27:14,300
If it were just Qian Lu alone,

392
00:27:15,700 --> 00:27:17,430
there would be nothing to fear.

393
00:27:19,300 --> 00:27:20,560
So Lord Lyu and the others...

394
00:27:20,560 --> 00:27:22,200
Adversity reveals true integrity,

395
00:27:22,200 --> 00:27:24,000
upheaval reveals true loyalty.

396
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:25,780
If even Lord Lyu
and the others are involved,

397
00:27:25,780 --> 00:27:26,540
then the officials in the court...

398
00:27:26,540 --> 00:27:27,470
This is nothing.

399
00:27:27,850 --> 00:27:28,630
Just wait.

400
00:27:29,020 --> 00:27:30,020
After today,

401
00:27:30,450 --> 00:27:33,460
the memorials asking me to allow
Prince of Han to act as regent

402
00:27:33,460 --> 00:27:35,630
will flood this hall.

403
00:27:37,700 --> 00:27:38,260
What?

404
00:27:39,220 --> 00:27:40,080
Are you scared?

405
00:27:41,220 --> 00:27:43,190
Your Majesty, please don't tease me.

406
00:27:43,190 --> 00:27:45,650
Among the prominent
eunuchs in this palace,

407
00:27:45,740 --> 00:27:48,270
there are few
that Prince of Han can tolerate.

408
00:27:48,610 --> 00:27:51,190
But I am definitely one he won't spare.

409
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:53,870
It's good that you know.

410
00:27:55,630 --> 00:27:56,430
Your Majesty.

411
00:27:56,610 --> 00:27:57,790
This matter of overseeing the state

412
00:27:57,790 --> 00:27:59,010
must come to an end.

413
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:01,040
What end?

414
00:28:01,500 --> 00:28:03,560
Just let it fade into the background.

415
00:28:06,610 --> 00:28:08,830
Why did you send our son to Jinling?

416
00:28:14,760 --> 00:28:16,870
Why did you send our son to Jinling?

417
00:28:24,870 --> 00:28:26,810
Why did you send him there?

418
00:28:29,850 --> 00:28:31,590
Isn't it just moving the capital?

419
00:28:31,590 --> 00:28:33,130
If you want to move it, just do it.

420
00:28:33,130 --> 00:28:34,630
Why be secretive about it?

421
00:28:36,500 --> 00:28:37,590
To me,

422
00:28:38,310 --> 00:28:41,160
moving the capital back to Jinling

423
00:28:41,670 --> 00:28:45,500
is something I can do but cannot say.

424
00:28:46,070 --> 00:28:47,610
Then you know very well

425
00:28:47,840 --> 00:28:50,350
that our son is unwilling
to move the capital.

426
00:28:50,350 --> 00:28:51,930
Yet you still sent him to Jinling.

427
00:28:51,930 --> 00:28:53,150
Do you want him to do it,

428
00:28:53,150 --> 00:28:54,610
or do you want him to say it?

429
00:28:54,670 --> 00:28:56,080
Do you think that by going to Jinling,

430
00:28:56,080 --> 00:28:58,210
he won't make things difficult for me?

431
00:28:58,550 --> 00:28:59,600
In his heart,

432
00:29:00,310 --> 00:29:02,940
he is first and foremost
Father's grandson.

433
00:29:03,500 --> 00:29:04,110
Then,

434
00:29:04,290 --> 00:29:06,550
he is the Crown Prince of the Ming Empire.

435
00:29:06,770 --> 00:29:09,960
Only lastly is he my son.

436
00:29:11,770 --> 00:29:13,700
Whether it's abolishing
the grain transport system

437
00:29:13,700 --> 00:29:14,980
or moving the capital,

438
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:17,140
as long as he talks to me nicely,

439
00:29:17,140 --> 00:29:19,340
everything can be discussed.

440
00:29:22,960 --> 00:29:24,560
Since I ascended the throne,

441
00:29:24,780 --> 00:29:27,630
he calls me "His Majesty" in public

442
00:29:28,250 --> 00:29:31,290
and "Imperial Father" in private.

443
00:29:33,110 --> 00:29:34,430
I can't remember

444
00:29:34,980 --> 00:29:36,900
the last time

445
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:41,830
he called me "Papa."

446
00:29:42,500 --> 00:29:43,430
Why don't you

447
00:29:44,330 --> 00:29:46,300
tell him these words yourself?

448
00:29:48,060 --> 00:29:49,630
I am his father.

449
00:29:50,570 --> 00:29:52,830
Whether by heavenly law or human ethics,

450
00:29:53,400 --> 00:29:56,200
there is no reason for me to bow to him.

451
00:29:56,700 --> 00:29:57,580
Like father, like son.

452
00:29:57,580 --> 00:29:59,160
You're both stubborn as mules.

453
00:29:59,160 --> 00:30:00,030
Now look,

454
00:30:00,170 --> 00:30:01,930
you're separated by thousands of li
from south to north.

455
00:30:01,930 --> 00:30:03,730
Let's see when you two will stop.

456
00:30:45,890 --> 00:30:47,820
Keep a close eye on the Wang family.

457
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,920
Don't let a single fly escape.

458
00:30:50,300 --> 00:30:50,830
Yes.

459
00:31:07,560 --> 00:31:08,630
Only steamed buns?

460
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:11,160
No pickles?

461
00:31:11,450 --> 00:31:12,980
Just eat what you're given.

462
00:31:13,680 --> 00:31:15,830
You seem quite smart

463
00:31:16,330 --> 00:31:17,300
and kind,

464
00:31:17,980 --> 00:31:19,110
but I think

465
00:31:19,830 --> 00:31:21,830
you still haven't figured life out.

466
00:31:21,890 --> 00:31:22,820
What do you mean?

467
00:31:23,980 --> 00:31:26,190
No matter how loyal you are,

468
00:31:26,740 --> 00:31:27,950
in Wang Ji's eyes,

469
00:31:28,450 --> 00:31:30,050
you're just a petty manager.

470
00:31:31,830 --> 00:31:33,080
The one in front of you right now

471
00:31:33,080 --> 00:31:34,210
is the Crown Prince.

472
00:31:34,500 --> 00:31:36,220
If you let us go,

473
00:31:36,950 --> 00:31:38,500
wealth and glory

474
00:31:38,780 --> 00:31:40,310
will be at your fingertips.

475
00:31:40,610 --> 00:31:41,220
What?

476
00:31:42,000 --> 00:31:43,190
Does the Crown Prince

477
00:31:43,190 --> 00:31:44,650
want to negotiate with me?

478
00:31:45,800 --> 00:31:46,860
You are not worthy.

479
00:31:47,680 --> 00:31:48,680
Call Wang Ji here.

480
00:31:49,110 --> 00:31:50,970
Tell Wang Ji to come and talk to us.

481
00:31:51,740 --> 00:31:53,700
You are prisoners now.

482
00:31:53,780 --> 00:31:55,500
Get a grasp of the situation.

483
00:31:56,150 --> 00:31:56,950
I think you are

484
00:31:57,500 --> 00:31:58,830
just asking for death.

485
00:31:59,280 --> 00:32:00,460
Then blame him.

486
00:32:00,930 --> 00:32:03,590
If you had just killed me that day,

487
00:32:03,610 --> 00:32:05,870
you wouldn't be in this situation today.

488
00:32:06,020 --> 00:32:06,950
I'm telling you,

489
00:32:07,190 --> 00:32:07,980
soon.

490
00:32:09,490 --> 00:32:10,010
Fine.

491
00:32:10,270 --> 00:32:11,800
Just eat what you're given.

492
00:32:12,740 --> 00:32:13,940
After your last meal,

493
00:32:14,590 --> 00:32:15,630
we'll send you on your way.

494
00:32:15,630 --> 00:32:16,500
I dare you!

495
00:32:27,090 --> 00:32:28,220
You're eating this?

496
00:32:28,430 --> 00:32:30,290
Aren't you afraid it's poisoned?

497
00:32:32,370 --> 00:32:34,500
We have to eat it
whether it's poisoned or not.

498
00:32:34,500 --> 00:32:35,720
I can't worry about all that.

499
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:36,850
Only when we're full

500
00:32:37,110 --> 00:32:38,950
will we have the strength to escape.

501
00:32:38,950 --> 00:32:39,500
Eat.

502
00:32:44,490 --> 00:32:46,360
[Guo's Mansion]

503
00:32:48,960 --> 00:32:49,460
Master.

504
00:32:49,480 --> 00:32:51,330
The young master's fiancée is here again.

505
00:32:50,740 --> 00:32:52,500
[Guo Chunzhi, prominent scholar
from Huaiyou, father of Guo Zhimin]

506
00:32:53,670 --> 00:32:54,460
Mr. Guo.

507
00:32:57,190 --> 00:32:59,530
Zhimin wasn't crushed to death
during the earthquake.

508
00:32:59,530 --> 00:33:00,950
He was murdered first,

509
00:33:01,080 --> 00:33:03,430
and the scene was faked
during the earthquake.

510
00:33:03,430 --> 00:33:04,890
Do you have proof for this?

511
00:33:04,960 --> 00:33:06,060
From his death to the closing of the case,

512
00:33:06,060 --> 00:33:07,630
it took less than half a day.

513
00:33:07,740 --> 00:33:09,540
Don't you find that suspicious?

514
00:33:09,740 --> 00:33:10,670
Who did it?

515
00:33:11,060 --> 00:33:12,540
Someone who wants
to kill the Crown Prince.

516
00:33:12,540 --> 00:33:15,140
What does this have to do
with the Crown Prince?

517
00:33:15,200 --> 00:33:16,770
You'll have to ask Wang Ji.

518
00:33:17,170 --> 00:33:17,830
Lord Zhan.

519
00:33:18,300 --> 00:33:19,630
Master Wang is not here.

520
00:33:19,970 --> 00:33:21,600
Wang Ji promised my master

521
00:33:21,620 --> 00:33:23,550
to hand over the Crown Prince to us.

522
00:33:23,830 --> 00:33:24,830
Now you're trying

523
00:33:25,430 --> 00:33:27,560
to brush this off by saying he's not in?

524
00:33:27,600 --> 00:33:29,130
Lord Zhan, you exaggerate.

525
00:33:29,250 --> 00:33:31,450
My master has always been dictatorial.

526
00:33:31,590 --> 00:33:32,630
If he is not here,

527
00:33:32,760 --> 00:33:34,500
I can't answer for him.

528
00:33:36,630 --> 00:33:37,830
Trying to send me away

529
00:33:38,260 --> 00:33:39,560
with such a flimsy excuse?

530
00:33:39,560 --> 00:33:40,130
No, no.

531
00:33:40,130 --> 00:33:41,260
Lord Zhan, you exaggerate.

532
00:33:41,260 --> 00:33:43,110
It's just that the matter is too serious.

533
00:33:43,110 --> 00:33:43,650
I...

534
00:33:43,650 --> 00:33:45,260
Can't you pass a message?

535
00:33:45,280 --> 00:33:46,360
Tell Wang Ji

536
00:33:46,980 --> 00:33:48,060
that before dark,

537
00:33:48,510 --> 00:33:50,020
he must hand over the Crown Prince to me.

538
00:33:50,020 --> 00:33:50,910
Otherwise,

539
00:33:51,190 --> 00:33:53,370
my master's cavalry will only need 2 hours

540
00:33:53,370 --> 00:33:54,970
to destroy the Wang's place.

541
00:33:56,050 --> 00:33:58,050
Think carefully before you answer.

542
00:34:00,560 --> 00:34:01,350
And you.

543
00:34:02,060 --> 00:34:03,650
If you don't want an ugly death...

544
00:34:03,650 --> 00:34:04,280
Stop.

545
00:34:05,380 --> 00:34:06,310
Stop, Lord Zhan.

546
00:34:09,489 --> 00:34:10,340
You and I

547
00:34:10,900 --> 00:34:12,960
are just dogs of our masters.

548
00:34:13,790 --> 00:34:15,449
Instead of barking like this,

549
00:34:15,600 --> 00:34:17,060
you should let your master

550
00:34:17,310 --> 00:34:19,270
talk to my master directly.

551
00:34:19,580 --> 00:34:20,429
Between us...

552
00:34:22,250 --> 00:34:23,310
You can't scare me.

553
00:34:40,909 --> 00:34:41,659
Old Mule.

554
00:34:42,600 --> 00:34:44,530
It seems your title as Crown Prince

555
00:34:44,770 --> 00:34:45,830
isn't of much use.

556
00:34:46,870 --> 00:34:48,530
They only gave us steamed buns

557
00:34:49,060 --> 00:34:50,310
without any meat.

558
00:34:52,179 --> 00:34:53,310
Good-for-Nothing.

559
00:34:53,560 --> 00:34:54,960
In a situation like this,

560
00:34:55,310 --> 00:34:57,170
you're still thinking about food?

561
00:34:57,170 --> 00:34:58,560
We're about to die.

562
00:34:59,040 --> 00:35:00,650
Of course I want a good meal.

563
00:35:01,980 --> 00:35:02,950
But seriously,

564
00:35:03,600 --> 00:35:05,130
I haven't lived enough yet.

565
00:35:08,810 --> 00:35:09,450
Why?

566
00:35:10,270 --> 00:35:11,130
Are you scared?

567
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:14,600
Is there anything in Jinling

568
00:35:14,890 --> 00:35:16,230
that you haven't seen?

569
00:35:16,430 --> 00:35:17,430
There's plenty.

570
00:35:18,660 --> 00:35:19,910
I'm not like you.

571
00:35:20,500 --> 00:35:21,910
You were born lucky.

572
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:23,950
You can eat whatever you want.

573
00:35:24,000 --> 00:35:25,020
You can drink

574
00:35:25,390 --> 00:35:26,450
whatever you want.

575
00:35:26,660 --> 00:35:28,540
And you live in such a big palace.

576
00:35:29,120 --> 00:35:30,580
How can I compare with you?

577
00:35:31,370 --> 00:35:35,210
In the palace, it's just 3 meals a day.

578
00:35:35,960 --> 00:35:38,230
I only sleep on a three-foot-wide bed.

579
00:35:40,910 --> 00:35:42,760
I just read books every day

580
00:35:44,750 --> 00:35:46,210
and listen to them preach.

581
00:35:47,590 --> 00:35:48,520
That's about it.

582
00:35:52,620 --> 00:35:53,910
Sounds like

583
00:35:54,930 --> 00:35:56,620
being the Crown Prince

584
00:35:57,500 --> 00:35:59,030
gives you no freedom at all.

585
00:35:59,950 --> 00:36:01,540
It's not even as good
as being a constable like me.

586
00:36:01,540 --> 00:36:02,800
That's presumptuous.

587
00:36:03,540 --> 00:36:05,020
You haven't eaten either.

588
00:36:05,370 --> 00:36:06,830
How do you still have the energy
to make such a racket?

589
00:36:06,830 --> 00:36:07,660
Take a break.

590
00:36:08,330 --> 00:36:09,460
Good-for-Nothing.

591
00:36:09,670 --> 00:36:11,400
I think you're quite carefree.

592
00:36:13,330 --> 00:36:14,100
As for me,

593
00:36:14,390 --> 00:36:15,390
I'm not tired,

594
00:36:15,810 --> 00:36:16,580
but

595
00:36:17,040 --> 00:36:18,450
I've had my share of suffering.

596
00:36:18,450 --> 00:36:19,620
Really?

597
00:36:20,120 --> 00:36:21,520
You're the Crown Prince.

598
00:36:21,730 --> 00:36:23,330
How could you have suffered?

599
00:36:24,430 --> 00:36:25,710
When I was very young,

600
00:36:27,810 --> 00:36:30,810
I went to fight the Northern Yuan
with my grandfather.

601
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:33,790
Once in the Wutengli Desert,

602
00:36:35,060 --> 00:36:36,950
we encountered a huge sandstorm.

603
00:36:38,230 --> 00:36:39,890
I got separated from my guards

604
00:36:40,020 --> 00:36:41,100
and lost my way.

605
00:36:41,950 --> 00:36:44,010
Fortunately, I met a Tatar herdsman.

606
00:36:44,270 --> 00:36:46,000
We looked for a way out together

607
00:36:46,010 --> 00:36:47,810
and walked for 5 days and nights.

608
00:36:48,850 --> 00:36:50,450
When thirsty, we drank horse urine.

609
00:36:50,450 --> 00:36:51,950
When hungry, we ate skinks

610
00:36:52,460 --> 00:36:53,620
and cowhide belts.

611
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:02,860
I didn't expect

612
00:37:04,990 --> 00:37:06,720
you to have suffered like this.

613
00:37:07,080 --> 00:37:08,060
A ruler

614
00:37:09,910 --> 00:37:11,040
should be like this.

615
00:37:13,270 --> 00:37:15,070
Setting an example for the world

616
00:37:15,100 --> 00:37:16,360
is truly respectable.

617
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,120
Take him away.

618
00:37:25,740 --> 00:37:26,800
What are you doing?

619
00:37:34,680 --> 00:37:36,340
What are you going to do to him?

620
00:37:36,390 --> 00:37:37,720
Inviting him to a meal.

621
00:38:49,210 --> 00:38:50,070
Your Highness.

622
00:38:50,810 --> 00:38:52,100
This is the Gold Scraps Banquet

623
00:38:52,100 --> 00:38:53,750
that I specially prepared

624
00:38:54,520 --> 00:38:55,430
for you.

625
00:38:57,850 --> 00:39:00,460
You tied me up for show.

626
00:39:01,180 --> 00:39:03,110
How can I even hold the chopsticks?

627
00:39:03,330 --> 00:39:03,910
I forgot.

628
00:39:16,210 --> 00:39:19,290
I know you're highly skilled
in martial arts, Your Highness.

629
00:39:19,290 --> 00:39:21,660
But my subordinates are rough men.

630
00:39:22,060 --> 00:39:23,920
Without my looking after things,

631
00:39:23,960 --> 00:39:25,820
they might accidentally hurt you

632
00:39:26,270 --> 00:39:27,770
if you leave the room alone,

633
00:39:27,770 --> 00:39:29,370
and I can't afford the blame.

634
00:39:34,180 --> 00:39:35,440
A Gold Scraps Banquet?

635
00:39:35,570 --> 00:39:36,140
Yes.

636
00:39:36,890 --> 00:39:38,090
Where are the dishes?

637
00:39:45,090 --> 00:39:46,510
This travel pass

638
00:39:46,880 --> 00:39:48,110
is the first dish.

639
00:39:49,600 --> 00:39:51,400
With this in hand, Your Highness

640
00:39:51,420 --> 00:39:53,350
can return to the capital by water.

641
00:39:54,180 --> 00:39:55,910
This ensures a smooth journey.

642
00:39:57,890 --> 00:39:59,220
What is the point of rice

643
00:39:59,930 --> 00:40:01,260
with no stove to cook it?

644
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:02,890
There is a stove.

645
00:40:04,120 --> 00:40:05,060
The second dish

646
00:40:05,230 --> 00:40:07,580
I have prepared for Your Highness

647
00:40:07,750 --> 00:40:09,020
is an excellent ship.

648
00:40:14,350 --> 00:40:15,790
An excellent ship?

649
00:40:16,140 --> 00:40:17,060
Could it be

650
00:40:17,660 --> 00:40:18,990
a second treasure ship?

651
00:40:21,430 --> 00:40:23,270
It's a tribute vessel.

652
00:40:24,500 --> 00:40:25,620
A tribute vessel?

653
00:40:26,000 --> 00:40:26,880
What kind of tribute?

654
00:40:26,880 --> 00:40:29,150
Usually, it's fruits, seafood,

655
00:40:29,380 --> 00:40:30,910
and freshwater produce.

656
00:40:31,560 --> 00:40:32,140
But

657
00:40:32,620 --> 00:40:33,980
after Your Highness rides it,

658
00:40:33,980 --> 00:40:36,440
it'll become an immortal vessel.

659
00:40:37,720 --> 00:40:39,110
Immortal?

660
00:40:39,540 --> 00:40:42,540
Riding in an immortal vessel
doesn't sound bad.

661
00:40:42,670 --> 00:40:43,870
There is a third dish.

662
00:40:44,230 --> 00:40:44,870
Speak.

663
00:40:45,060 --> 00:40:45,950
It's a person.

664
00:40:46,100 --> 00:40:46,710
Who?

665
00:40:46,870 --> 00:40:47,500
A sinner.

666
00:40:47,620 --> 00:40:48,480
Guilty of what?

667
00:40:53,120 --> 00:40:53,950
I, Wang Ji,

668
00:40:54,500 --> 00:40:56,100
presented the treasure ship
that was blown up,

669
00:40:56,100 --> 00:40:58,180
putting the Crown Prince in danger.

670
00:41:09,940 --> 00:41:13,200
I can personally escort Your Highness
back to the capital.

671
00:41:22,140 --> 00:41:22,870
Wang Ji,

672
00:41:23,660 --> 00:41:25,310
I don't understand.

673
00:41:26,000 --> 00:41:28,430
You're betting your life on this.

674
00:41:29,640 --> 00:41:31,180
What are you up to?

675
00:41:32,620 --> 00:41:35,180
I hope Your Highness will be generous

676
00:41:35,770 --> 00:41:36,830
and write a letter.

677
00:41:38,830 --> 00:41:40,120
What kind of letter do you want?

678
00:41:40,120 --> 00:41:41,380
A letter of guarantee.

679
00:41:41,730 --> 00:41:42,500
One day,

680
00:41:42,750 --> 00:41:43,850
when you ascend the throne,

681
00:41:43,850 --> 00:41:44,710
take the crown,

682
00:41:44,810 --> 00:41:46,040
and become the Emperor,

683
00:41:46,040 --> 00:41:48,500
please don't forget
my escort along the way.

684
00:41:49,620 --> 00:41:50,390
Go on.

685
00:41:51,540 --> 00:41:53,710
Make me an official.

686
00:41:54,850 --> 00:41:56,430
You don't want to be a merchant anymore.

687
00:41:56,430 --> 00:41:57,890
You want to be an official?

688
00:41:59,750 --> 00:42:01,580
Scholars, farmers, craftsmen,
and merchants.

689
00:42:01,580 --> 00:42:02,660
Scholars rank first.

690
00:42:02,660 --> 00:42:03,390
Besides,

691
00:42:03,840 --> 00:42:06,900
my descendants can receive
a stipend for generations.

692
00:42:10,160 --> 00:42:11,020
Wang Ji.

693
00:42:11,790 --> 00:42:13,450
I really underestimated you.

694
00:42:14,460 --> 00:42:16,430
So you want to be a marquis,

695
00:42:17,250 --> 00:42:19,180
but you have no military achievements.

696
00:42:19,180 --> 00:42:20,790
Why should I grant you a title?

697
00:42:20,790 --> 00:42:21,650
Your Highness.

698
00:42:22,060 --> 00:42:24,020
It's a long journey

699
00:42:24,100 --> 00:42:25,810
from Yangzhou to the capital.

700
00:42:26,290 --> 00:42:27,910
It's as good as a battle.

701
00:42:33,060 --> 00:42:33,980
I see.

702
00:42:35,060 --> 00:42:37,730
You want to be like
Chai Shizong of the Song Dynasty.

703
00:42:37,730 --> 00:42:38,580
You are wise, Your Highness.

704
00:42:38,580 --> 00:42:39,600
And you want a monument erected for you?

705
00:42:39,600 --> 00:42:40,330
Is that possible?

706
00:42:40,330 --> 00:42:41,670
Of course not.

707
00:42:42,270 --> 00:42:43,470
The ancestral system

708
00:42:43,540 --> 00:42:44,870
cannot be changed here!

709
00:42:45,350 --> 00:42:46,400
What about making an exception?

710
00:42:46,400 --> 00:42:47,260
No exceptions.

711
00:43:05,590 --> 00:43:07,360
Please think twice, Your Highness.
